{"title": "Entangle (Dryad)", "pageid": 22299, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Entangle_(Dryad)", "categories": ["Spells", "Cantrips", "Strength saving throws", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Entangle_Dryad.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Entangle_Dryad.webp/300px-Entangle_Dryad.webp, /w/images/1/18/Entangle_Dryad.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Entangle_Dryad.webp/300px-Entangle_Dryad.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/18/Entangle_Dryad.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Entangle</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">cantrip</a>. This spell allows spellcasters to conjure magical vines and turn an area within range into difficult terrain. Creatures are possibly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Entangled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\">Entangled</a> and move at half speed while standing in this area.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nCreate a vine surface, slowing down creatures, possibly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Entangling\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\">Entangling</a> them.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\"